      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel your own pain is creating a shadow over your child, and that pain is a normal part of the healing process. While it isn't easy to let go of that fear, seeking help for yourself is actually the most powerful thing you can do to break that cycle. Many adults and children grow together through these difficult times, and the support you give your child to cope will help them build their own future.",
      "source": "target",
