    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it never ends. it's always something new, always another struggle. i just look at them and i see how much weight they carry because of me. sometimes i think the only way they'd ever truly be free, to actually have a chance at a normal life, is if i just wasn't an obstacle anymore. like i'm just a constant drain on their happiness.",
