      "content": "I hear the deep pain in your words, and please know that no matter how heavy the struggle feels, you are not a \"drain\" for your family. While you feel like your pain overshadows theirs, the very act of trying to protect them often teaches them resilience and empathy for the future. Sometimes the path out of this darkness only exists when we allow ourselves to be healed, so I encourage you to seek a therapist who can help you find hope and relief for both of you.",
